title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-08-iam-deny/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: v2 principals, v3 queries, cleanup
├── terraform/          3 resources: custom role, binding, deny policy
├── scripts/            validate.sh - asks Troubleshooter v3, never v1
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  the deny policy's exception list is the part worth reading.
# scripts/    v1 answers GRANTED while a deny is blocking. v3 is the
#             only instrument that can see the control being tested.
